{"id": 12342, "jp_tail": "アヤノ】「……」", "zh": "【Ayano】「……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12343, "jp_tail": "ウイチ】「……」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12344, "jp_tail": "ちは黙り込んだ。", "zh": "就那样，我们沉默了下来。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12345, "jp_tail": "つからなかった。", "zh": "想对Yuichi说点什么，却找不到合适的话。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12346, "jp_tail": "たかと思うと――", "zh": "不久，先前还接连不断升空的烟花，似乎停了一阵――", "score": 90, "note": "软锁：维持 opus（锚点定译，P5 读感不足以推翻）", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12347, "jp_tail": "打ち上げられた。", "zh": "紧接着，一朵大烟花伴着格外响亮的声音升上了天空。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12348, "jp_tail": "終わり、かな？」", "zh": "【Ayano】「结束了……吧？」", "score": 90, "note": "软锁：维持 opus（锚点定译，P5 读感不足以推翻）", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12349, "jp_tail": "チ】「……うん」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「……嗯」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12350, "jp_tail": "「ね、ユウイチ」", "zh": "【Ayano】「呐，Yuichi」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12351, "jp_tail": "ウイチ】「ん？」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「嗯？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12352, "jp_tail": "……えっと……」", "zh": "【Ayano】「……那个……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12353, "jp_tail": "きなんだろうか。", "zh": "在这里，是不是应该向Yuichi告白呢。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12354, "jp_tail": "を壊したくは――", "zh": "可是……现在，我不想破坏和Yuichi的关系――", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12355, "jp_tail": "だよ、アヤノ？」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「干嘛啊，Ayano？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12356, "jp_tail": "、なんでもない」", "zh": "【Ayano】「……对不起，没什么」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12357, "jp_tail": "風も出てきたし」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「……这样啊。差不多该走了吧。也起风了」", "score": 65, "note": "「风也起来了」非惯用搭配（汉语说「起风了」）；改「也起风了」，保留原文「も」的「也」", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12358, "jp_tail": "ノ】「……うん」", "zh": "【Ayano】「……嗯」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12359, "jp_tail": "と、屋上を出た。", "zh": "我们站起身，离开了天台。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12360, "jp_tail": "、まだ聞こえる。", "zh": "烟花的声音，还听得见。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12361, "jp_tail": "んね、ユウイチ」", "zh": "【Ayano】「对不起哦，Yuichi」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 12362, "jp_tail": "ウイチ】「……」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 17022, "jp_tail": "が完結しました。", "zh": "故事模式：章节３Ｂ已完结。", "score": 95, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
